# Test fixtures — provider payloads (JSON / HTML) are curated offline
# snapshots used by the unit tests. They live in the repo on purpose so
# the data-ci workflow can run pytest without network access. The
# download_fixtures script is a developer tool for refreshing them on
# demand, NOT a CI step.
